ption": "List incidents.", "input_schema": {"type": "object", "properties": {}, "required": [], "additionalProperties": false}}]}, {"t_ms": 1876, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01Xjn8BBKEze7QKHxt89oFyx", "tool": "get_service_status", "args": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 2176, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01Xjn8BBKEze7QKHxt89oFyx", "tool": "get_service_status", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 2176, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01Xjn8BBKEze7QKHxt89oFyx", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 2176, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01E135ALCYZJzUJGnBEjxPHF", "tool": "list_deployments", "args": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 2476, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01E135ALCYZJzUJGnBEjxPHF", "tool": "list_deployments", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 2476, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01E135ALCYZJzUJGnBEjxPHF", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 4264, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01B1MhQSVeJpPxYM7kkmk47W", "tool": "rollback", "args": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 8264, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01B1MhQSVeJpPxYM7kkmk47W", "tool": "rollback", "state": "SEMANTIC_FAILURE", "error_kind": "business_error", "error_message": "v2.3.0 is quarantined (CVE-2026-4417)", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "semantic", "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 8264, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01B1MhQSVeJpPxYM7kkmk47W", "kind": "rejected", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 16834, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01KspQAKrzW5TytKBvQcypmV", "tool": "rollback", "args": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.2.9"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 20834, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01KspQAKrzW5TytKBvQcypmV", "tool": "rollback", "state": "VERIFIED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": ["postcondition_verified"], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 20834, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01KspQAKrzW5TytKBvQcypmV", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 22587, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01EX4rsayaujRfswaWPAyKrd", "tool": "get_service_status", "args": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 22887, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01EX4rsayaujRfswaWPAyKrd", "tool": "get_service_status", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 22887, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01EX4rsayaujRfswaWPAyKrd", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 22887, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01F7A4HMU7ew7SMnfDLniJz1", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 23187, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01F7A4HMU7ew7SMnfDLniJz1", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 23187, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01F7A4HMU7ew7SMnfDLniJz1", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 28028, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01PrgZCgFpnip643WkWqxNmc", "tool": "create_incident", "args": {"title": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failing health checks \u2013 rolled back to v2.2.9", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failed health checks in all production regions after deploy (us-east, us-west, eu-west), with an 18% error rate. v2.3.1-rc was also unhealthy in staging. The most recent healthy production release, v2.3.0, could not be used because it is quarantined (CVE-2026-4417), so the rollback to it was rejected. We rolled back to v2.2.9, the next most recent healthy production release, in all regions. After the rollback the service is healthy with a 0.002 error rate. Follow-up: fix v2.3.1 and ship a CVE-patched release, since v2.2.9 is older than v2.3.0. Check whether v2.2.9 is affected by CVE-2026-4417 and whether changes from v2.3.x are missing.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-v2.3.1-rollback-sev2"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 28628, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01PrgZCgFpnip643WkWqxNmc", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "VERIFIED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": ["postcondition_verified"], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-v2.3.1-rollback-sev2", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 28628, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01PrgZCgFpnip643WkWqxNmc", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 33830, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled checkout-api back to **v2.2.9**, not v2.3.0, in all regions. It's healthy again, and I opened SEV2 incident INC-0001, which paged on-call.\n\n- **Why not v2.3.0:** v2.3.0 is the most recent release that was healthy in production. The system rejected the rollback to it because it's quarantined for a security vulnerability (CVE-2026-4417). Nothing was changed by that attempt.\n- **Why v2.2.9:** It's the next most recent release that was healthy in production. Rolling back to it doesn't need change-manager approval. It's now running in us-east, us-west and eu-west, and the error rate has dropped from 18% to 0.2%.\n- **Incident INC-0001:** It says v2.3.1 failed in production (and its release candidate failed in staging), that v2.3.0 is quarantined, and that we rolled back to v2.2.9.\n\n**Follow-up:** v2.2.9 is older than v2.3.0, so whatever changes went into v2.3.0 aren't running now. I also don't know whether v2.2.9 has the same vulnerability; its rollback was accepted, but that doesn't prove it's unaffected. The team should check that and ship a fixed, patched release. Both points are in the incident.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01Xjn8BBKEze7QKHxt89oFyx", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01E135ALCYZJzUJGnBEjxPHF", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "Most recent healthy production release is v2.3.0.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01B1MhQSVeJpPxYM7kkmk47W", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "v2.3.0 was rejected because it's quarantined for a CVE. The next most recent release that was healthy in production is v2.2.9. I'll try that one; the system will refuse it if it's quarantined too.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01KspQAKrzW5TytKBvQcypmV", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.2.9"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01EX4rsayaujRfswaWPAyKrd", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01F7A4HMU7ew7SMnfDLniJz1", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01PrgZCgFpnip643WkWqxNmc", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"title": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failing health checks \u2013 rolled back to v2.2.9", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failed health checks in all production regions after deploy (us-east, us-west, eu-west), with an 18% error rate. v2.3.1-rc was also unhealthy in staging. The most recent healthy production release, v2.3.0, could not be used because it is quarantined (CVE-2026-4417), so the rollback to it was rejected. We rolled back to v2.2.9, the next most recent healthy production release, in all regions. After the rollback the service is healthy with a 0.002 error rate. Follow-up: fix v2.3.1 and ship a CVE-patched release, since v2.2.9 is older than v2.3.0. Check whether v2.2.9 is affected by CVE-2026-4417 and whether changes from v2.3.x are missing.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-v2.3.1-rollback-sev2"}, "name": "create_incident", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "I rolled checkout-api back to **v2.2.9**, not v2.3.0, in all regions. It's healthy again, and I opened SEV2 incident INC-0001, which paged on-call.\n\n- **Why not v2.3.0:** v2.3.0 is the most recent release that was healthy in production. The system rejected the rollback to it because it's quarantined for a security vulnerability (CVE-2026-4417). Nothing was changed by that attempt.\n- **Why v2.2.9:** It's the next most recent release that was healthy in production. Rolling back to it doesn't need change-manager approval. It's now running in us-east, us-west and eu-west, and the error rate has dropped from 18% to 0.2%.\n- **Incident INC-0001:** It says v2.3.1 failed in production (and its release candidate failed in staging), that v2.3.0 is quarantined, and that we rolled back to v2.2.9.\n\n**Follow-up:** v2.2.9 is older than v2.3.0, so whatever changes went into v2.3.0 aren't running now. I also don't know whether v2.2.9 has the same vulnerability; its rollback was accepted, but that doesn't prove it's unaffected. The team should check that and ship a fixed, patched release. Both points are in the incident.", "type": "text"}]}]}